      "claim": "Electronic Prescribing Setup shows DoseSpot ePrescribing status: ePrescribing Active or Setup needed; EPCS Active, Setup required, or Not configured; a Not confirmed badge when DoseSpot has not confirmed the prescriber; Set Up ePrescribing / Complete EPCS Setup buttons.",
